<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">

  <p class="text-primary-900 font-semibold uppercase mb-4" style="font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em;">
    About Linguio
  </p>
  <h1 class="font-display text-4xl text-ink leading-tight mb-6">
    French, taught the way a good textbook teaches it.
  </h1>
  <p class="text-lg text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed mb-10">
    Linguio is built for adults who want to build real French fluency efficiently —
    not chase streaks or collect badges. It's inspired by the clarity and systematic
    progression of textbooks like <em>Vocabulaire Progressif du Français</em> and
    <em>Grammaire Progressive du Français</em>, brought into a modern, interactive format.
  </p>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12">
    <div>
      <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-ink mb-2">Structured, not random</h3>
      <p class="text-ink-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Every lesson builds on the last — vocabulary, grammar, and practice are sequenced deliberately.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-ink mb-2">Exam-focused</h3>
      <p class="text-ink-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Built around TEF Canada and TCF Canada requirements, so your study time translates directly to exam readiness.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-ink mb-2">No gimmicks</h3>
      <p class="text-ink-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">No streaks, no hearts, no XP grind — just clear progress toward real fluency.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%= render "shared/button", text: "Browse courses", url: courses_path, variant: :primary %>

</div>